        <body>
            <div xml:id="d523">

                <pb facs="0586" n="470" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg470"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.00/1159.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>
                            <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Cape Haitien</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-04-25T15:00:00-04:49">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 25, 1915—3 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>One hundred revolutionists favoring Bobo entered Cape Haitien at 2 o’clock today
                    without opposition.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Livingston</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
